                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "I'm excited to apply for the Product Designer II role at Razorpay. Over the past four years I've led end-to-end design for checkout and onboarding flows at two fintech startups, and I'm drawn to Razorpay's focus on building payment infrastructure that scales with modern businesses.",
